[[Image:Saltspray Glen.jpg|thumb|Saltspray Glen]]
[[Saltspray Glen]] is a small area in the northwestern [[Wetlands]] bordered by [[Bluegill Marsh]] to the south, [[Ironbeard's Tomb]] to the east, and [[Baradin Bay]] to the north and west. Like [[Black Channel Marsh]], [[Whelgar's Excavation Site]], and [[Raptor Ridge]], Saltspray Glen is crawling with the numerous [[raptor]]s who nest here. The glen is so named for the ease with which the ocean throws seawater inland here when there is a strong wind blowing off from the bay.

