[[File:Sal'Galaz Mines.png|thumb|300px|The Sal'Galaz Mines.]]
'''Sal'Galaz Mines''' is located in the southeastern part of the [[Grim Reaches]]. Formerly occupied by the [[Wildhammer dwarves]] of [[Dun Kithas]], the mine has been overrun by [[Bonesplitter]] troggs ever since a cursed gemstone has been unearthed.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|35|Reclaiming Sal'Galaz}}</ref> The Sal'Galaz Mines kept [[Slatebeard's Forge]] supplied with the ore necessary to outfit the mountaineers of Dun Kithas.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|32|Ore Must Flow}}</ref>

