The '''Sanctum of Blood''' is an area located in deep within the [[Stormwrought Descent]] in [[Stormwrought Ruins]]. It is from there that the [[Shadow Council]] operates on [[Balor]], and the [[Remains of the Innocent]] and [[Lady Drazare]] can be fought here. The deepest recesses of the sanctum houses the [[Temple of Shadows]], where the Shadow Council seeks to summon [[Mergothid|Mergothid the All-Seeing]].

